WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,860
The largest sow weighs over 200 pounds

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,460
The ones that are a few and a half big are not small either.

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:24,130
It wasn't me who made the noise, Tiger

4
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,400
Can't run

5
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,400
Turn your back to the tiger

6
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,400
Just to die

7
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:50,180
I really killed a tiger

8
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:55,390
Meat delivered to your door
